 — Apgar Beach / classic Lake McDonald view</name><description>Colored shoreline stones, lake reflections, and the mountain corridor to the northeast.</description><Point><coordinates>-113.991999,48.528257,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D2 L4 Parking — The Loop pullout parking</name><description>Parking for The Loop roadside overlook</description><Point><coordinates>-113.800428,48.754865,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>L4 View — The Loop valley viewpoint</name><description>Hairpin road, forested valley, steep mountainsides, and westward depth.</description><Point><coordinates>-113.800428,48.754865,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D2 L5 Parking — Big Bend pullout</name><description>Parking for Big Bend viewpoint</description><Point><coordinates>-113.72478,48.727637,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>L5 View — Big Bend main panorama</name><description>Broad view across the upper McDonald valley, waterfalls, road, and alpine peaks.</description><Point><coordinates>-113.72478,48.727637,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>L5 View — Big Bend upper shoulder photo angle</name><description>A slightly elevated angle toward the valley and Garden Wall.</description><Point><coordinates>-113.72403,48.72794,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D2 L6 Parking — Logan Pass Visitor Center parking</name><description>Parking for Logan Pass → Hidden Lake Overlook</description><Point><coordinates>-113.71826,48.69539,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>L6 Trail start — Hidden Lake Nature Trail start behind visitor center</name><description>Logan Pass → Hidden Lake Overlook</description><Point><coordinates>-113.71826,48.69539,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>L6 View — Hanging Gardens / alpine boardwalk area</name><description>Alpine meadow, boardwalk, peaks, flowers, and frequent wildlife habitat.</description><Point><coordinates>-113.731082,48.69128